    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d257">

                <pb facs="0743" n="708" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v25/pg708"/>

                <head>257. Backchannel Message From President Nixon to Egyptian President Sadat<anchor n="1" xml:id="d257-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1973-10-24T10:17:00-04:00">undated</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>We have just been informed by the Israeli Prime Minister that strict instructions
                    have been issued to Israeli armed forces to stay in defensive positions and not
                    to fire unless they are fired upon.</p>
                <pb facs="0744" n="709" xml:id="pg709"/>
                <p>In response to your proposal for U.S. ground observers,<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d257-f2"/> the Israeli Government has also agreed to permit U.S.
                    military attachés to proceed immediately to the area of the conflict in order to
                    observe that these orders are being carried out.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d257-f3"
                    /></p>
                <p>It would be very helpful at this time if you could instruct your own forces
                        accordingly.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d257-f4"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
